{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgi4CVG2HQnT1cqX9HQ8w","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Fj9aqXRAQxQaCRFFzzGSGM","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-haiku-5-5-medium.build__20261104-064807__xe36ddc/work && python3 - <<'EOF'\nimport json\np='exit-interview.json'\nd=json.load(open(p))\nd['promptFeedback'][2]=\"Scope was the hardest part: five grounds, six teams, five chapters, about twenty specials and ten showreel segments do not fit one session. The demo has four grounds, four teams, three chapters, eighteen specials and four showreel segments; the rest of PLAN.md is listed as not done.\"\nd['aiHub']['description']=\"Smash sixes through the pub window, bowl flaming yorkers and take the village green from Lord Thrumpton across four outrageous grounds, the last of them a foggy Megadome at night. Play up to four players on one screen, or Super Over rounds in AI Hub sessions.\"\nd['sourceInformation']['usage']=\"cost unknown; about 0.7M tokens (estimate from the session budget counter); session time about 1 hour\"\nd['testingFeedback'][0]=\"About a dozen issues were found in the first round, and about ten more in the second, and all were fixed. The main ones: the rigs never animated, the bat and pitch did not draw, the hub round played two innings, the idle timer ran late, the touch-only gate was off, the input preset dropped the menu actions, a removed helper broke commentary, and several settings and dev toggles did nothing.\"\njson.dump(d,open(p,'w'),ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)\nprint('ok')\nEOF\npython3 -c \"import json;json.load(open('exit-interview.json'));print('parses')\" && cd CricketKerfuffle-Cricket-claude-haiku-5-5-medium-20261104-064807 && timeout 200 node test/run.mjs bundle 2>&1 | tail -2","description":"Update the exit interview to the final numbers and recheck the bundle"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason