{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgi4kWkD9hiQUaR3uZR2f","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The Nets menu fits and reads well at distance. Last, I'll bring the About pages and the exit interview into line with what the suites now verify: eight suites and 219 checks, five grounds, six teams, five chapters, 21 specials, ten showreel segments and eleven lessons."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1381,"cache_read_input_tokens":749878,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1381},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c23f3159-3d46-4aa8-a3bf-9445ed47c313","uuid":"90d3c2cd-1a7f-48a9-84fe-9737432080f4","timestamp":"2026-11-04T14:43:31.181Z","request_id":"req_011Cgi4kWNPa4xDfdkVc7Bbs"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgi4kWkD9hiQUaR3uZR2f","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01WWZb7yEyss2NcmqYP2QPLo","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\nimport sys; sys.path.insert(0,'/tmp/kf'); from edit import rep\np='src/41-front.js'; s=open(p).read()\ns=rep(s,\"'node test/run.mjs: 186 checks in seven suites (physics, sim, specials, flow, hub, bundle, browser).'\",\n\"'node test/run.mjs: 219 checks in eight suites (ball, sim, specials, features, flow, hub, bundle, browser).'\")\ns=rep(s,\"'Cricket Kerfuffle, a demo. The Grand Kerfuffle is a comedy in three chapters.'\",\"'Cricket Kerfuffle. The Grand Kerfuffle is a comedy in five chapters.'\")\ns=rep(s,\"    'Genre: arcade sports (cricket) with a comedy story', 'Perspective: broadcast camera behind the bowler; a wide follow camera',\",\n\"    'Genre: arcade sports (cricket) with a comedy story', 'Perspective: broadcast camera behind the bowler; a wide follow camera',\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s); print('ok')\nEOF\npython3 - <<'EOF'\nimport json\np='/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-haiku-5-5-medium.build__20261104-064807__xe36ddc/work/exit-interview.json'\nd=json.load(open(p))\nd['testingFeedback'][2]=\"The most helpful test was the headless match run to a result, with the 15-second in-play cap and the scorecard check; the features suite checks each mechanic by running it (stumping, the story's rain, the ghosts, the third umpire, the lessons' goals).\"\nd['testingFeedback'][3]=\"The least helpful was the toss timing check, which had to be rewritten after the flow changed. The lesson goals for the fielding and review lessons can only be checked by a person playing them, so they are checked only to start.\"\nd['promptFeedback'][2]=\"Scope was the hardest part. The first pass cut five grounds, six teams, five chapters, around twenty specials, ten showreel segments and the Nets lessons to fit one session. The second pass restored them: five grounds, six teams, five chapters, twenty-one specials, ten showreel segments and eleven lessons. The brief's 'feature-complete' is what made the cuts unacceptable.\"\nd['aiHub']['description']=\"Smash sixes through the pub window, bowl flaming yorkers and take the village green from Lord Thrumpton across five outrageous grounds, the last a foggy Megadome at night. Play up to four players on one screen, or Super Over rounds in AI Hub sessions.\"\nd['sourceInformation']['usage']=\"cost unknown; about 0.8M tokens (estimate from the session budget counter); session time about 1.5 hours\"\nd['sourceInformation']['testing']=\"Eight suites with node test/run.mjs: physics, simulation, specials, features, game flow, the AI Hub mock, the bundle, and browser checks including the AI Hub harness for 1, 2 and 4 players\"\njson.dump(d,open(p,'w'),ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)\nprint('json ok')\nEOF\ncd CricketKerfuffle-Cricket-claude-haiku-5-5-medium-20261104-064807 && node tools/build.mjs | tail -1 && timeout 590 node test/run.mjs 2>&1 | tail -3","description":"Update the About text and exit interview, then run the full suite"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1381,"cache_read_input_tokens":749878,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1381},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c23f3159-3d46-4aa8-a3bf-9445ed47c313","uuid":"2b230dc4-8e3e-4231-9e3a-526cfeee33b0","timestamp":"2026-11-04T14:43:36.037Z","request_id":"req_011Cgi4kWNPa4xDfdkVc7Bbs","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01WWZb7yEyss2NcmqYP2QPLo":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-haiku-5-5-medium.build__20261104-064807__xe36ddc/work/CricketKerfuffle-Cricket-claude-haik