{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgi5U8dcF376cDjTFJf7a","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Progress: lessons 1, 2, 3, 6 and 8 now pass through their inputs. The remaining failures are mostly bot bugs, which I can see from the numbers. The charge and aftertouch presses check the time since the run-up started, not since release, so they never fire. The multiplayer bot presses once per ball and loses the first press during the fade, so it stalls the same way. I'll fix both bots, then trace lesson 11 and the fielding lessons to see what's real."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":532,"cache_read_input_tokens":810789,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":532},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c23f3159-3d46-4aa8-a3bf-9445ed47c313","uuid":"80f8511a-57d7-4fff-a1a3-6106ca9120ab","timestamp":"2026-11-04T14:52:58.880Z","request_id":"req_011Cgi5U8BZiyTFtHYJ86zgM"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgi5U8dcF376cDjTFJf7a","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01GCCeMM5zjRMXpiVvZ6Qwsn","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\nimport sys; sys.path.insert(0,'/tmp/kf'); from edit import rep\np='test/suites/play.mjs'; s=open(p).read()\ns=rep(s,\"  let pressedFor = -1, holdUntil = -1, runAt = -1, dir = null, lastShot = -1, setupAt = -9;\",\n\"  let pressedFor = -1, holdUntil = -1, runAt = -1, dir = null, lastShot = -1, setupAt = -9, flightAt = -9, prevPhase = '';\")\ns=rep(s,\"    if (!s.phase) return;\\n    const ball = s.logLen;\",\n\"    if (!s.phase) return;\\n    const ball = s.logLen;\\n    // the moment the ball left the hand: the start of its flight, as the screen shows it\\n    if (s.phase === 'flight' && prevPhase !== 'flight') flightAt = now;\\n    prevPhase = s.phase;\\n    const sinceRelease = now - flightAt;\")\ns=rep(s,\"        if (s.phase === 'flight' && s.dt !== null && s.dt < 0.05 && pressedFor !== ball) { pressedFor = ball; I.tap('charge'); }\",\n\"        if (s.phase === 'flight' && sinceRelease < 0.05 && pressedFor !== ball) { pressedFor = ball; I.tap('charge'); }\")\ns=rep(s,\"        if (s.phase === 'flight' && s.dt !== null && s.dt < 0.06 && lastShot === ball && dir === null) { dir = 'right'; I.hold('right', true); holdUntil = now + 0.1; }\",\n\"        if (s.phase === 'flight' && sinceRelease < 0.06 && lastShot === ball && dir === null) { dir = 'right'; I.hold('right', true); holdUntil = now + 0.1; }\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\np='test/suites/multi.mjs'; s=open(p).read()\ns=rep(s,\"      if (s.phase === 'setup' && last.release !== 'setup' + s.logLen) { p.tap('shot'); last.release = 'setup' + s.logLen; }\",\n\"      if (s.phase === 'setup' && now - (last.setupAt || -9) > 0.5) { p.tap('shot'); last.setupAt = now; }\")\ns=rep(s,\"    g.game.advance(1 / 120); steps++;\\n    s = g.game.debug.live();\",\n\"    g.game.advance(1 /