{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgi5kyg5U8LAPho9s3GAu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The multiplayer suite passes now: co-op and 2-v-2 are both played through every joined player's buttons to a result. The fielding and review lessons need chances that the CPU rarely creates. I'll give those lessons their own settings: lesson 9 gets lofted CPU shots, lesson 10 gets ground balls to gather, and lesson 11 gets a wider bowling scatter so LBW calls come up, with an umpire who is often wrong so that reviews arise."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1691,"cache_read_input_tokens":835244,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1691},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c23f3159-3d46-4aa8-a3bf-9445ed47c313","uuid":"d7630c80-ee19-459e-bdee-97201196bf54","timestamp":"2026-11-04T14:56:51.134Z","request_id":"req_011Cgi5kyHFhTNVgpdR8SMz1"}
