{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgi694TfN4xCWRReiNNEG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The stop hook fires again on the same gap, and I can't meet it honestly while three lessons fail. I'll try one more concrete pass on the two causes I can now point to, rather than stopping on the same report.\n\n1. **Lesson 10:** a gathered ball still counts as a carried catch chance, so the human's catch ring can hold up the throw. A gathered ball shouldn't be a catch chance.\n2. **Lesson 9:** the bot presses on every step of the catch ring, so it resolves early. It should press when the ring reaches its moment, so I'll expose the ring's time to the bot and press at that point."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2304,"cache_read_input_tokens":869788,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2304},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c23f3159-3d46-4aa8-a3bf-9445ed47c313","uuid":"876ddaae-4b0b-43fc-8596-df369a5adf8d","timestamp":"2026-11-04T15:01:45.579Z","request_id":"req_011Cgi69437Qanpyu3QiuuAX"}
