{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgi7Cag43VEwdLTux44VK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'll make the LBW model change now, as a deliberate and reversible change, instead of more tuning. The simulation currently requires a predicted hit within 3.5 units of the middle stump, which only a bowled ball can meet, so no LBW can arise. The batter's pad is what separates an LBW from a bowled ball, and the pad is wider than the stump's line. I'll allow a predicted hit within 7 units to count as a pad hit. A straight ball pitched 3.5 to 14 units off the line then becomes an LBW candidate, and bowled stays for a ball pitched on the stumps."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1927,"cache_read_input_tokens":952937,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1927},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c23f3159-3d46-4aa8-a3bf-9445ed47c313","uuid":"46d8172d-2a9e-4367-8d23-3ecdcd626596","timestamp":"2026-11-04T15:15:40.284Z","request_id":"req_011Cgi7CZtRb5GQftUyLdxVp"}
