{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017EJdzsJmp8MjwG1RN12FyK","type":"tool_result","content":"== ball\na solved delivery pitches\nsolved deliveries pitch within three units of the target (no swing; drag and the step make up the rest)\nan outswinger drifts away from a right-hander\nan inswinger drifts into him\nthe predictor equals the stepped simulation\na rolling ball stops\na dropped ball rebounds lower than it was dropped\na full ball on the straight is a straight drive\na full ball through the covers is a cover drive\na short ball on the leg side is a pull\na loft on a full ball straight is a lofted straight\na loft on a short ball on the leg side is a hook\na block on a good length is a forward defence\na yorker is dug out\na contact on the arrival is PERFECT\na contact 60 ms late is GOOD\na press 200 ms early is a miss\na contact 100 ms late is LATE\nthe Kerfuffle Method: 60 first runs, 2 overs, 1 left, no wicket gives 31\nthe Kerfuffle Method: 100 runs, 3 overs, 2 left, 2 down gives 67\na new innings starts with the first batter on strike\nthe batting side is the match\\\nthe fielders are placed: nine positions and a keeper\nevery shot has a name for the callout\n== sim\nthe bot matches include a four\nthe bot matches include a wicket\nthe bot matches include runs being run\na one-over match finishes\na machine delivers its list in order\na seeded delivery stream gives the same speeds on every copy\n== play\n== multi\n== hub\nthe hub client is asked to connect in parallel with seats 1 to 4\nready is called with no key press\na round sends a progress at the start and one after each ball\nthe round sends one result at its end\nthe result has the score\nthe two copies face the same deliveries\nno errors in a round\ntime-up sends a result at once\na second time-up sends no second result\nend freezes the round\nno errors after end\nthe pause menu has no Restart or Dev mode in a session\n== bundle\nthe single file exists in the 