{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Xy5FEhqT4ENsVyJmqsTNyv","type":"tool_result","content":"- `input.feed(type, x, y, o = {})` †: a pointer event in screen pixels, as the browser's would give: feed('down' | 'move' | 'up', x, y, { touch: false, button: 0, id: 0 (which finger, for zones) }) (a test's or a bot's mouse and fingers: clicks, boxes, long presses, double taps and pans follow; a finger in one of the zones holds its act), or feed('zoom', x, y, { k: 1.1 }): a wheel's notch or a pinch about that point\n2629:  mouseGround() { const m = this.input.mouseScreen(); return m ? this.view.toGround(m[0], m[1]) : null; }\n1094:  feed(type, x, y, o = {}) {\n1095-    if (type === 'zoom') { this._zoomAcc *= o.k || 1.1; this._zoomPt = [x, y]; return; }\n1096-    if (!o.touch) this._fedAt = [x, y];\n1097-    const S = this.screen, z = o.touch && type === 'down' && this.zones && this._zone(x / S.W, y / S.H);\n1098-    if (z) { this._zoneDown('fed' + (o.id || 0), z); return; }   // (a finger in a zone: its act, no gesture)\n1099-    if (o.touch && type === 'up' && this._zoneOf.has('fed' + (o.id || 0))) { this._zoneUp('fed' + (o.id || 0)); return; }\n1100-    if (type === 'down') { this._fed = [x, y]; if (!o.touch) this.press('Mouse' + (o.button || 0)); this._gesture('down', x, y, { touch: !!o.touch, button: o.button || 0, id: 'fed' }); }","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c23f3159-3d46-4aa8-a3bf-9445ed47c313","uuid":"f1662259-3b09-46c1-a050-fb18d9964337","timestamp":"2026-11-04T15:44:01.230Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"- `input.feed(type, x, y, o = {})` †: a pointer event in screen pixels, as the browser's would give: feed('down' | 'move' | 'up', x, y, { touch: false, button: 0, id: 0 (which finger, for zones) }) (a test's or a bot's mouse and fingers: clicks, boxes, long presses, double taps and pans follow; a finger in one of the zones holds its act), or feed('zoom', x, y, { k: 1.1 }): a wheel's notch or a pin